  "problem": "Compute $\\text{E}[-8X]$ if $\\text{E}[X]=0.5.$",
  "worked_solution": "For any constant $a$ and any random variable $X,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[aX]=a\\text{E}[X].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[-8X] & =-8\\text{E}[X] \\\\  & =(-8)(0.5) \\\\  & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
